# This repository holds the planning and design documents only.
#
# The code lives in its own repositories, checked out as sibling folders here:
#
#   JeevikaService/      → github.com/priyanktomer/JeevikaService
#   Yapan/               → github.com/priyanktomer/yapan
#   access-app/          → github.com/priyanktomer/access-app
#   super-methods/       → github.com/priyanktomer/super-methods
#   mysql-multitenancy/  → github.com/priyanktomer/mysql-multitenancy
#
# They are ignored here so this repo never turns them into gitlinks — cloning
# this on a fresh machine should give you the documents, and you clone the code
# repos beside it.
JeevikaService/
Yapan/
access-app/
super-methods/
mysql-multitenancy/

# ── OS / editor ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# ── Scratch ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log

# ── Deployment secrets (PLAN-5 Phase 11) ─────────────────────────────────
# Every value in deploy/.env is a credential — database passwords, the Redis
# password, the ACME contact. deploy/.env.example is the committed template and
# carries no values.
deploy/.env
deploy/*.env
!deploy/.env.example
